==English==

===Etymology===
From {{uder|en|la|-}} ''[[ligula]]'', diminutive of ''liga''.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[strap]]-shaped structure.
# {{lb|en|botany}} A portion of a [[leaf]] found at the base of the [[petiole]], when present.
# {{lb|en|botany}} In many [[grass]]es (Poaceae) and some sedges (Cyperaceae), the membranous appendage or ring of hairs projecting from the inner side of a [[leaf]] at the junction between the [[blade]] and the [[sheath]].

